      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Laredo CBP officers are busy! \n\nBack in July, officers discovered 16 packages inside of a shipment of bell peppers. Of course, the packages did not hold more bell peppers, they contained almost 38lbs of cocaine! Two days later, officers sized 50 more pounds of cocaine inside of a car.\n\nThe narcotics total street value is $1,175,967.\n\nRead: https://t.co/4qeGvUyY6Y",
